    "updated_at": "2022-06-11T16:15:46Z",
    "body": "I was actually able to cross-compile it locally using [`cross`](https://github.com/cross-rs/cross). In detail for anyone similarly not overly rust-familiar:\r\n\r\n1. Install rustup\r\n2. (Optionally) Add `~/.cargo` to your path\r\n3. Install `cross`\r\n4. Then just run `cross build --target <target> --release` where in this case `<target>` == powerpc64le-unknown-linux-gnu`",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
